y grant partial access to the Philae Monolith, not full ownership.",0,""],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_103","a","002",0.64,-0.23,-1.45,0,"star",0.0],["w",0.25],["say","avg4_999","But seeing the bond between you and your companions made me want to help out too.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_401"],["say","avg4_999","So please accept a trial run of this mission's reward: the Monolith Melody.",0,""],["w",0.4],["mrt",2,"cb","002","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","What's that?",1,""],["mrt",3,"cb",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["say","avg4_999","Basically, I'll play soothing music to help everyone relax and fall asleep.",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,180.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_112","e","007",0.45,-0.17,1.25,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,"flower",0.24,null,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.8],["w",0.7],["say","avg1_112","That sounds fun! Like a lullaby? I'm in. Let's try it out. I'm actually getting sleepy.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_112","e",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["stg",0,-120.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"cb","021","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","So it's basically a music player...?==W== Alright, if it helps us sleep, go ahead, Vita. Thanks.",1,""],["w",0.8],["mrt",0,"cb","022","exclamation","jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"ca",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["bgm","m137"],["se","se_025_stop"],["se","se_401"],["w",0.5],["say","avg4_999","Your command is my will.",0,""],["stg",0,null,-165.0,null,"InOutCubic",10.0,null,null,null],["w",0.8],["clear",0,0,1],["w",1.85],["fx",0,"fx_avg_speaking",1,2],["w",1.3],["bg","story_main_01_006_c",0,1.0],["cbg",0,120.0,30.0,null,"OutSine",0.0,null,null,null],["w",2.3],["bg","sky_night_b",0,1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.085,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"JingTouYaoHuang"],["w",2.0],["mrt",2,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg4_999","Tyrant, may tonight's starlight and sweet dreams wash away the exhaustion for you and your companions.==W==",1,""],["w",1.8],["goon"],["mrt",3,"ca",null,null,null],["w",0.51],["end"]]}